    "title": "🧪 Session 29 — Lab 10: Using Deep Freeze to Preserve Physical Systems|||🧪 Buổi 29 — Lab 10: Using Deep Freeze to Preserve Physical Systems",
    "slug": "iam303-flm-b029",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
